[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0378","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0378.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1229","title":"Xiph.org Icecast libshout 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Icecast 1.3.9 之前版本及 libshout 1.0.4 之前版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过发送特制的恶意数据流触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝（进程崩溃）乃至远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Icecast 流媒体服务器及 libshout 客户端库的早期版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可导致机密性/完整性/可用性均受影响。攻击者可通过向 Icecast 服务器发送畸形流媒体数据或诱导客户端连接恶意服务器触发漏洞，最终在目标系统上以服务进程权限执行任意代码。官方已在 Icecast 1.3.9 和 libshout 1.0.4 中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1229"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:51.273","remediation":"建议立即升级 Icecast 到 1.3.9 或更高版本，并将 libshout 升级到 1.0.4 或更高版本。可从官方站点 icecast.org 下载最新版本并替换原有二进制文件。若暂时无法升级，可在防火墙层面限制 Icecast 服务端口（默认 8000）仅允许受信任 IP 访问，或暂时停用 Icecast 服务作为临时缓解措施。建议同时升级依赖 libshout 的客户端应用至 1.0.4 以上版本。升级后重启服务并验证版本号确认修复生效。务必从官方源下载以防供应链投毒。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000387","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98438880622976&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-063.html","http://www.xiph.org/archives/icecast/0074.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a4c15d247e2aa1e32bb9712f81631be3a25fb82/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1229.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1229","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1229.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eba749de89f8c70fe7dc7fa1f83de98dd5147c06/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1229.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jv77-c9mf-jr67/GHSA-jv77-c9mf-jr67.json","https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-ports/blob/58376fbc0dd642d78dda39e7bbfa81a124730b7d/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1229.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icecast_libshout_bof.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/freebsd_pkg_5e92e8a25d7b11d880e30020ed76ef5a.nasl","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2004/FreeBSD-2004-0016.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0378.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0234","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0141","title":"mgetty 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"mgetty 1.1.22 在处理文件写入操作时存在符号链接（symlink）竞争条件漏洞。在特定配置下，本地攻击者可通过在临时目录中创建恶意符号链接，诱使 mgetty 进程将数据写入攻击者指定的任意文件路径，从而实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞利用需要本地系统访问权限且依赖特定配置环境，攻击复杂度较高，但成功利用后可导致系统文件被篡改，影响系统完整性。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0141"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44.993","remediation":"升级 mgetty 至 1.1.24 或更高版本（该版本已修复临时文件创建中的竞态条件问题）。各发行版用户请安装对应安全更新：Debian 安装 DSA-011 更新包，Red Hat 安装 RHSA-2001-050 更新包，Mandrake 安装 MDKSA-2001-009 更新包。临时缓解措施：确保 /tmp 目录设置粘滞位（sticky bit），并限制不可信用户本地登录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-002.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-011","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-009.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-050.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2187","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5918","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0141","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0141.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xmp5-g5f6-23g3/GHSA-xmp5-g5f6-23g3.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-011.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0141.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2008/debian/deb_011.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0234.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0232","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0232.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0131","title":"Apache HTTP Server htpasswd 和 htdigest 符号链接攻击漏洞","description":"Apache HTTP Server 的 htpasswd 和 htdigest 工具存在符号链接（symlink）竞争漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱使这些工具在创建或更新密码文件时跟随符号链接写入任意文件，导致目标文件被覆盖或破坏。该漏洞影响 Apache 1.3.14、2.0a9 及早期版本，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限，CVSS 评分 3.3，危害等级低。建议升级至 Apache 1.3.17 及以上版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":3.3,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0131"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:43.830","remediation":"升级 Apache 至 1.3.20 或 2.0.16 及以上版本，这些版本已修复 htpasswd/htdigest 在创建临时文件时未检查符号链接的问题。如无法升级，确保运行 htpasswd/htdigest 的目录仅由受信任用户写入，或使用 umask 限制文件权限，避免攻击者通过符号链接覆盖系统关键文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-021","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2182","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5926","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0131","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0131.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0131.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-h5gj-xw8w-hmjf/GHSA-h5gj-xw8w-hmjf.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-195.nasl","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0131.yaml","https://github.com/shlin168/go-nvd/blob/21d8c0da4b600f0598ead6b6691178d8a4e547a0/db/mongo.go","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-188.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0232.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0230","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0230.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0128","title":"Zope Zope 本地角色权限提升漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2.4 之前版本存在本地角色计算缺陷，已认证用户可通过精心构造的请求绕过预设的访问控制限制，获取超出其权限范围的管理员或更高权限。该漏洞源于 Zope 对用户本地角色（Local Roles）的权限判定逻辑不完善，导致角色继承与权限边界校验失效。攻击者只需拥有普通用户账户即可利用此漏洞，无需特殊网络条件，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0128"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42.550","remediation":"立即将 Zope 升级至 2.2.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了本地角色计算不当导致权限绕过的缺陷。如无法立即升级，可临时移除受影响用户的本地角色分配，改用全局角色替代，并严格审查用户权限配置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000365","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001219","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/updates/2000/MDKSA-2000-083.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/6284","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-127.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5777","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0128","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0128.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1decc7ade63192f9f527bfb87145d1636c01cc59/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0128.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-wqxw-f744-5fh2/GHSA-wqxw-f744-5fh2.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_400_500.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/anonymous-55443259/CVE_Vul_File_Localization/blob/24756649f99ff5cea566f1e66a7fdd2ed0e7aced/Result/repository/repository_collection/repo_from_gpt/result/CVE-2001-0128/final.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-269.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4bf1d4ab-0352-471d-8175-3b0d86d91c66.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0230.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0228","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0228.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0117","title":"GNU diffutils sdiff 本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"diffutils 工具包中的 sdiff 2.7 版本存在符号链接（symlink）攻击漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在临时文件目录中创建恶意的符号链接，诱使 sdiff 在处理文件差异时跟随该链接，从而覆盖系统上任意文件。该漏洞利用条件较为苛刻（需要本地访问权限且攻击复杂度高），仅影响文件完整性，不涉及机密性和可用性。受影响的系统包括使用 diffutils 2.7 版本的各类 Linux/Unix 发行版。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0117"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41.240","remediation":"建议升级 diffutils 包至修复版本：Red Hat Linux 用户安装 RHSA-2001:116 提供的更新包（diffutils-2.7-6.1 及以上），Mandrake Linux 用户安装 MDKSA-2001:008 更新。修复原理是 sdiff 改用 mkstemp/mkstemps 创建临时文件而非可预测路径，消除 symlink 竞争条件。如无法升级，可移除 sdiff 的 setuid 权限或限制普通用户对临时目录的写权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2000-70-028-01","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97916374410647&w=2","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/579928","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-008.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-116.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2191","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5914","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0117","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0117.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-424f-vwfw-m7pm/GHSA-424f-vwfw-m7pm.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0117.json","https://github.com/dmc5179/rhsa-tools/blob/677b19c223fe2771414f7b2fc89b4a4f39d25719/cvrfs/RHSA-2001:116.json","https://github.com/deshalit/async_prog/blob/2a58e64a10a9fe3859356f4b80fc7f40a4683d0c/08/app/startup_db.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0228.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0226","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0226.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0108","title":"PHP Apache 模块 .htaccess 安全绕过漏洞","description":"PHP Apache 模块 4.0.4 及更早版本存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向未受限制的页面发送特制的畸形 HTTP 请求，导致 PHP 错误地将该请求的访问控制策略应用到后续请求的页面上，从而绕过 .htaccess 文件设置的身份验证和访问限制。该漏洞影响使用 mod_php 的 Apache Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致未授权访问受保护的资源或敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0108"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40.240","remediation":"升级 PHP Apache 模块至 4.0.5 或更高版本。Debian 用户应安装 DSA-020 提供的 php3 更新包；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2000:136 提供的更新；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2001:013 更新。如无法升级，可在 Apache 配置中禁用 PHP 的 .htaccess 重载功能（AllowOverride None）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000373","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97957961212852","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-020","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-013.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-136.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2206","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5940","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0108","https://github.com/psecio/versionscan/blob/81cee8accd05924b8421db9ed2a867047819d15a/CONTRIBUTING.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0108.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0108.json","https://github.com/zmerry/z-marvel.github.io/blob/581a79f0e7ceb8cdb3e444922154e004cca44bbb/vulbox/webvul/middle/PHP%20Apache%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2001-0108).html","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0108.yaml","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-020.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0226.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0226.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0055","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0055.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0144","title":"SSH 1.2.x CRC-32 补偿攻击检测器整数溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SSH 1.2.x 协议实现的 CRC-32 补偿攻击检测器中存在整数溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可在未授权情况下向 SSH 服务器或客户端发送特制的数据包触发此漏洞，利用 CRC-32 检测机制的整数回绕缺陷绕过安全检测，最终实现在目标系统上远程执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 SSH 1.x 协议版本的实现，危害评级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0144"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:45.333","remediation":"立即升级至 SSH-2.0 或更新版本，SSH-1.2.x 协议存在 CRC-32 补偿攻击整数溢出漏洞。如无法升级，在服务端配置中禁用 SSH1 协议支持（Protocol 2），并替换为 OpenSSH（3.0+ 版本已完全移除 SSH1 兼容性代码）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98168366406903&w=2","http://razor.bindview.com/publish/advisories/adv_ssh1crc.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-35.html","http://www.osvdb.org/503","http://www.osvdb.org/795","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2347","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6083","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20617","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0144.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0144.json","https://github.com/mudongliang/LinuxFlaw/blob/7738b4e61bddf979fe10215125da19bcb99d2318/README.md","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1327.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0144.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ssh_crc32.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8262-f9hh-4786/GHSA-8262-f9hh-4786.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0144","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/1326.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0055.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0054","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0054.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0137","title":"Microsoft Windows Media Player 7 皮肤文件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows Media Player 7.0 存在任意 Java 小程序执行漏洞。远程攻击者可将恶意 Java 小程序封装在名为 skin.wmz 的皮肤文件中，然后通过 HTML 页面中 applet 标签的 codebase 参数引用该皮肤文件，诱使用户在 Internet Explorer 中访问恶意页面即可触发。成功利用该漏洞的攻击者可在客户端系统上以当前用户权限执行任意 Java 代码。该漏洞影响 Windows Media Player 7.0 及关联的 Internet Explorer 环境，CVSS 评分 5.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0137"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:44.537","remediation":"升级到 Windows Media Player 7.1 或更高版本（Windows Media Player for Windows XP 及以上版本不受影响），该漏洞已在 Windows Media Player 7.1 中修复。也可安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS01-010 对应的补丁。同时建议在 Internet Explorer 中禁用 Java 小程序执行作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958100816503&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2203","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2001/ms01-010","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5937","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20553","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0137","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0137.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-67pp-g8pj-rw94/GHSA-67pp-g8pj-rw94.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0137.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7268edf9-197b-4869-954b-4f466bab1c93.json","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/Christopher0129/security-knowledge-base/blob/ecec748afe5bbe2fcd2fd04b00fb46bc827b2c5d/system-vulnerabilities/macos.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0054.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0054.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0054.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0052","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0129","title":"Tinyproxy HTTP代理 远程堆溢出漏洞","description":"Tinyproxy HTTP 代理服务器 1.3.3 及更早版本中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送特制的长连接请求触发该漏洞，导致目标代理服务崩溃，且可进一步利用该溢出实现在受影响系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Tinyproxy 1.3.3 及之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0129"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:42.687","remediation":"升级 Tinyproxy 至 1.3.4 或更高版本。官方修复方案为将 `utils.c` 中 `httperr()` 函数的 `sprintf(outbuf, premsg, err, msg, msg, err, msg, VERSION)` 改用 `snprintf(outbuf, BUFFER, premsg, err, msg, msg, err, msg, VERSION)` 防止缓冲区溢出。如无法升级，可在代理服务器防火墙规则中限制仅允许受信任源 IP 访问 Tinyproxy 端口（默认 8888），以降低外部攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-0