1-0051.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0123","title":"eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 1.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 file 参数提交包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制请求，绕过路径限制读取目标服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于程序未对用户输入的文件路径进行充分过滤和校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0123"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41.967","remediation":"立即升级 eXtropia bbs_forum.cgi 至 1.0 以上已修复版本，或迁移至仍受支持的论坛系统（如 phpBB、Discourse）。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器层（Apache/Nginx）限制对 bbs_forum.cgi 的访问权限，仅允许可信 IP 调用，并启用 mod_security 规则拦截 `..` 目录遍历特征及 shell 命令注入载荷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97905792214999&w=2","http://www.extropia.com/hacks/bbs_security.html","http://www.osvdb.org/3546","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2177","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5906","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20533","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0123","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0123.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j557-rjj6-7225/GHSA-j557-rjj6-7225.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/dangerous_cgis.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0123.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150700_150800.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0051.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0049","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0049.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0115","title":"Sun Solaris arp 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 7及更早版本中的arp命令存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向arp命令传递超长的-f参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意代码，获取系统最高权限。该漏洞影响Solaris 7、Solaris 2.6及更早版本，CVSS评分7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞，漏洞已公开多年且有明确的利用方法，建议用户升级到Solaris 8或安装Sun安全公告200号提供的补丁进行修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0115"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:41.017","remediation":"安装 Sun Security Bulletin #200 提供的 Solaris 7 补丁 106980 或更新至 Solaris 8 以上版本。如无法升级，临时缓解措施为移除 arp 命令的 setuid 权限：chmod u-s /usr/sbin/arp，仅允许 root 用户执行 arp 操作。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97934312727101&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97957435729702&w=2","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/200&type=0&nav=sec.sba","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2193","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5928","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/250","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0115.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0115","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0115.md","htt