loitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40.693","remediation":"升级 splitvt 至 1.6.5 或更高版本。于 Debian/Ubuntu 系统可执行 `apt-get update && apt-get install --only-upgrade splitvt`；于 Red Hat/CentOS 可执行 `yum update splitvt`。若无法升级，可通过 `chmod 750 /usr/bin/splitvt` 限制二进制文件的可执行权限，仅允许受信任用户使用该程序，降低本地提权风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958269320974&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-014","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2210","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/260","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0112.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0112","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0112.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0112.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-014.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hpx4-vfrw-237w/GHSA-hpx4-vfrw-237w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2210/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0112.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0046","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0111","title":"Debian splitvt 格式字符串漏洞","description":"splitvt 是一款终端分屏工具，其 1.6.5 之前版本在处理 `-rcfile` 命令行参数时存在格式字符串漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向该参数传递特制的格式化字符串，利用 printf 类函数的内存读写缺陷覆盖任意内存地址，从而以 root 权限执行任意代码，实现本地提权。该漏洞影响 Debian 2.2 及其他使用受影响版本 splitvt 的系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0111"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:40.580","remediation":"立即将 splitvt 升级至 1.6.5 及以上版本。对于已停止支持的 Debian 2.2 系统，建议升级到受支持的操作系统版本。如无法升级，可移除 splitvt 的 setuid 权限并限制本地用户执行 splitvt 以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97958269320974&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-014","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2210","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5948","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20556","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0111.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0111","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0111.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0111.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-014.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6748-8gv9-q5pj/GHSA-6748-8gv9-q5pj.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/f